If you levelport down, the left side won't be full of spawned monsters
and such.  Much faster and safer even if you don't have cursed !gain
level.

In any event, you don't want to "clean out" the graveyard, you can just
cut a small path through it if you have stealth (even if you lack
telecontrol, you can often get to the left side quickly by just cutting
a small path through the graveyard and moving left, thereby avoiding
lots of additional monsters on the left).

Without stealth, you just kill what you need to to move on the way out.



